WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.205 --> 00:00:03.441
检查本次Client的Ask模式 / Inspect Ask for this Client

2
00:00:03.441 --> 00:00:06.545
打开Composer / Open Composer

3
00:00:06.545 --> 00:00:09.697
新建本次Collection请求 / Create this Collection request

4
00:00:09.697 --> 00:00:13.182
打开请求的重命名入口 / Open the request rename action

5
00:00:13.182 --> 00:00:16.275
保存名称Guide UI request / Save the name Guide UI request

6
00:00:16.275 --> 00:00:19.336
填写本次自有UI请求地址 / Enter the owned UI request URL

7
00:00:19.336 --> 00:00:22.574
添加公开示例Header / Add the public example Header

8
00:00:22.574 --> 00:00:25.934
通过UI Send读取guide-ui-response / Send through UI and read guide-ui-response

9
00:00:25.934 --> 00:00:28.992
等待Collection实际保存 / Wait for the Collection to be saved

10
00:00:28.992 --> 00:00:32.061
只读获取实际保存的Collection / Query the actually saved Collection

11
00:00:32.061 --> 00:00:35.179
检查Composer发送的实际审批 / Inspect the actual Composer send approval

12
00:00:35.179 --> 00:00:38.306
Deny不发送网络请求 / Deny without sending a network request

13
00:00:38.306 --> 00:00:41.907
重新请求同一个明确目标 / Request the same explicit destination again

14
00:00:41.907 --> 00:00:45.021
Allow后核对真实POST与201结果 / Allow and verify the real POST and 201 result

15
00:00:45.021 --> 00:00:48.075
Tool结果不替换当前UI响应 / Tool results do not replace the current UI response

16
00:00:48.075 --> 00:00:51.130
检查Collection替换的实际范围 / Inspect the actual Collection replacement scope

17
00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:54.223
Deny保留原Collection / Deny and retain the original Collection

18
00:00:54.223 --> 00:00:57.281
用同一已读取版本重新请求 / Request replacement from the same read revision again

19
00:00:57.281 --> 00:01:00.467
Allow后查看当前UI自动同步 / Allow and observe notification-driven UI synchronization

20
00:01:00.467 --> 00:01:03.511
重新读取最终保存版本 / Query the final saved revision

21
00:01:03.511 --> 00:01:07.092
回到本次MCP设置 / Return to this MCP configuration

22
00:01:07.092 --> 00:01:10.745
关闭演示Client连接与Server / Close the demo Client connection and Server
